  "result": "Type check is clean and the full test suite passes (616/616). The fix addressed three bugs in `src/server/repositories/organization-repository.ts`, `src/server/services/feature-flag-service.ts`, and `src/lib/feature-flags.ts`:\n\n1. `updateOrg` was unioning the new `enabledFlagOverrides` list with the stored one instead of replacing it, so removing a flag from the list was always silently reverted — turning an override off never stuck.\n2. `toggleFlag`'s guard only rejected non-overridable flags whose strategy wasn't `\"plan\"`, so a non-overridable, plan-gated flag like `webhooks` could still be switched on and persisted.\n3. `isEnabled` honored a stored override for any flag regardless of `overridable`, so even if an override for a non-overridable flag got into storage, it would still take effect.",
